{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "System-prompt section registry (ADR-18 D1/D2, ADR-19 D1). `scope` decides whether a template joins the system prompt (`system`) or is rendered by its request call site (`request`); assembly order is code in `agent/prompts/assembler.py`, and `tier`/`gate` are registration metadata only.",
